      ],
      "content": "TRING                  AKEMAN STREET SP 9211                                         (West side) 11/44                                   South Obelisk in -                                       front of Akeman Street                                         Baptist Church GV                                      II Obelisk. Circa 1851, in memory of James Page, 5 years Pastor of Church, d.1851.  Painted stone.  One of 2 identical memorials flanking path, facing E. Short obelisk with moulded base, set on tall tapering plinth with moulded cap and base and inscription on E face. Low stone surround with stone blocks at middle of each side and small obelisks at corners. Listing NGR: SP9232911311"
    }
